{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tuple(int)} |= ndim(v_1) = v_2.len ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, v_2.len - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = v_2[i]

Rule 12 (a primitive type variable is smaller than the other)
{v_1 : int ⊎ float, v_2 : int ⊎ float} |= v_1 ≤ v_2

Rule 8 (tensor must have an integer dtype: 1–5)
{v1: tensor} |= 1 ≤ dtype(v1) ∧ dtype(v1) ≤ 5

